From 6ee062118edbe55d845bf33dfbe150cd647f64b4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alan Bradburne <abradburne@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 16:10:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] nibOS: a platform profile for nibOS on the Anbernic RG DS+

PortMaster lives in the user's data folder (~/.local/share/PortMaster) and the
ports in Roms/PORTS on the games card (/mnt/ds) or the ROMS partition. Ports run
as the user (no sudo, no bind mounts), on the top screen (SDL display priority
DSI-2), with the one gamepad nibos-input makes.

- device_info.txt and hardware.py: nibOS by /usr/lib/nibos/board.conf.
- config.detect_paths(): nibOS's directories (tests).
- platform/nibos.py: nibos/control.txt replaces control.txt after updates.
- nibos/: control.txt, launch_hooks.txt, PortMaster.txt, gamecontrollerdb.txt.
- mod_nibOS.txt.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
